  npcName: Beetrix
  lines:
  - welcome to the weapon shop! the counter's right in front of you.
  - the frying pan is my best seller. don't ask.
  - use a weapon from your bag to hold it. shift + click for a heavy swing!
  - the mushroom knight in the south woods? good luck, friend.
